0077:     Rule:
0078:     - Each colored legend shape defines a mapping: hole count → color.
0079:     - For every grey sprite, count its holes (enclosed bg regions not touching the sprite's bounding-box border).
0080:     - Recolor the grey sprite to the matching legend color; erase grey distractors with unlisted hole counts.
